My fourth ascension, first priest. The others were two wizards and a
valkyrie.

Early Ring of Slow Digestion made a lot of difference somehow. Also,
I'd just read some old Rob Ellwood posts on forgetting spellcasting,
identifying and enchanting until later. I tried it, and what do you
know!

I also got to Heck for the first time since I installed the patch. I
like it, and I don't think I want to go back. Like everyone else, I
have saved game files with characters below the castle, because
Gehennom isn't fun (although I just learned about buying clairvoyance,
which makes the whole Hell trip much less painful. Anyway, Heck feels a
lot like Gehennom, but not boring.

I kept having trouble with mind flayers. I wasted two wishes from the
castle wand wishing for identify and enchant armor. And when I
identified everything, there was my blessed scroll of genocide, which I
had ignored while being eaten by two different mind flayers.

Anyway, an interesting game.

